[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4020.309, "timestamp": "01:07:00", "text": "作品。是的。是的。是的。仓库。呃，什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4029.829, "timestamp": "01:07:09", "text": "如果我没记错的话，我们……我们……那是为了什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4032.47, "timestamp": "01:07:12", "text": "我们的第一次合作？那是《命运2》，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4034.39, "timestamp": "01:07:14", "text": "正确的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4037.67, "timestamp": "01:07:17", "text": "哦，是吗？是的。我的天啊。那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4040.51, "timestamp": "01:07:20", "text": "那些日子。很久以前。很久"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4045.349, "timestamp": "01:07:25", "text": "前。那是很久以前的事了。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4047.51, "timestamp": "01:07:27", "text": "我们好久没一起玩了。我们没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4055.43, "timestamp": "01:07:35", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4059.19, "timestamp": "01:07:39", "text": "嗯，是啊，那都是很久以前的事了，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4068.87, "timestamp": "01:07:48", "text": "也许是22岁，因为我其实没做什么大事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4074.549, "timestamp": "01:07:54", "text": "我只记得我们当时好像在做……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4078.71, "timestamp": "01:07:58", "text": "命运试炼等等，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4079.75, "timestamp": "01:07:59", "text": "地牢。我不记得了"}]